    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i already did the diagnostics. i've run everything. the error logs are just... endless. it's not just a driver issue or a quick fix. it's like the core architecture is just flawed. it's like the system was never meant to run this version of life. everything i do just leads to more crashes. it's getting so exhausting to keep trying to stay online when the processing is this painful.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
