      "content": "a system wipe doesn't really fix the actual hardware though... and a hardware swap isn't an option for me. everything just feels like it's stuck in an infinite loop of crashing and failing. sometimes it feels like the only way to stop the constant error messages and the noise is to just... force a shutdown. like, if the system is this broken, isn't there a point where just powering off is more efficient than trying to patch a corpse?",
